  ('4a35865b-0a95-421d-bc89-c22095891eda', '2026-09-21 09:02:12.611913+00', '3d40f6e5-08ad-4cf3-a92b-0a31058da012', 'ebunregina.ism@gmail.com', 'super-admin', 'INSERT', 'announcements', '990d4208-1bf0-4ffa-9b76-30e0c976ddc0', 'ANNOUNCEMENT FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 21ST, SEPTEMBER 2026.', NULL, NULL, '{"id": "990d4208-1bf0-4ffa-9b76-30e0c976ddc0", "body": "‎2 Peter 3:18 - But grow in grace, and in the knowledge of our Lord and Saviour Jesus Christ. To him be glory both now and for ever. Amen.\n‎\n‎IT''S OUR MONTH OF GROWTH AND STILL IN THE SEASON OF MANIFESTATIONS. GLORY BE TO GOD!\n‎\n‎COUNTING ON ALL OUR ESTEEMED SENIOR CELL LEADERS AND MINISTERS WHO ARE YET TO ORGANIZE ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE TO KINDLY ORGANIZE ISM MINISTERS'' AND LEADERS CONFERENCE AND USE IT TO MOBILIZE THEIR LEADERS (WORKFORCE) IN PREPARATION FOR THE UPCOMING HEALING STREAMS LIVE SERVICES\n‎\n‎Be a part of it as we strategize with our man of God to reach the last lost soul, by confirming your dates!!!\n‎\n‎Register your conference @:\n‎https://ministersconference.christembassy-ism.org\n‎\n‎We are available for effective planning and execution with you and your team. Contact your liaison manager\n‎\n‎\n‎🙏 Global Day of Prayer (27th Edition) & Global Prayer and Fasting\n‎📅 Friday, 25th – Sunday, 27th September 2026\n‎\n‎🍂 OCTOBER 2026\n‎💫 Healing Streams Live Healing Services\n‎📅 Friday, 23rd – Sunday, 25th October 2026\n‎🏢 Onsite\n‎\n‎🙏 Global Prayer and Fasting\n‎📅 Tuesday, 27th – Thursday, 29th October 2026\n‎\n‎🍁 NOVEMBER 2026\n‎🌍 International Pastors’ and Partners’ Conference ( IPPC) Monday, 9th – Sunday, 15th November 2026🏢 Onsite\n‎\n‎\n‎Global Prayer and Fasting.\n‎Friday 25th- Sunday 27th September, 2026\n‎\n‎Other Important announcements for today are as follows:\n‎1. REGISTER TODAY FOR THE ISM ONLINE SCHOOL:\n‎➡ @ school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎SO MUCH TO EXPECT AND GAIN AT THE ISM ONLINE SCHOOL\n‎\n‎ENROL NOW- school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎\n‎2. NOW AVAILABLE: THE REBROADCAST OF INSPIRING MONTH OF SEPTEMBER CELL LEADERS TRAINING WITH THE HIGHLY ESTEEMED EXECUTIVE MINISTER\n‎\n‎Participation Links:\n‎For ISM Cell Leaders:\n‎https://app.christembassy-ism.org/cell\n‎\n‎For ISM Cell Members and Stakeholders:\n‎https://school.christembassy-ism.com/training\n‎\n‎3. POST - GMC ACTIVITIES:\n‎\n‎3A. HAPPENING THROUGHOUT THIS SEASON: ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE in your city, country and region\n‎\n‎kindly choose a date and Start planning for the meeting with your liaison manager\n‎We are available for effective planning and execution with every team.\n‎\n‎Register your conference @:\n‎https://ministersconference.christembassy-ism.org\n‎\n‎B. All ISM cell leaders and ministers are encouraged to take and compete at least 1 course in the online school program this month of August\n‎\n‎LINK: school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎\n‎C. GET THESE NEWLY DEVELOPED SOLUTION KITS FOR ISM MINISTERS BY OUR DEAR MAN OF GOD, PASTOR CHRIS:\n‎\n‎1. MYSTERIES ABOUT MONEY: https://ce-ism.org/yLKj4C\n‎\n‎2) SUCCESS PLAYBOOK: https://ce-ism.org/tukgBC\n‎\n‎Kindly click and register first to get your login details before purchasing any of the packages.\n‎\n‎4. Book of the Month is - HOW TO MAKE YOUR FAITH WORK. We are reading Chapters 6- 11 this Week.\nKindly visit @ismprayernetwork.org/bookstore to get your e-copy.\n‎\n‎We look forward to receiving testimonies of maximum attendance and great exploits from your Prayer meetings @ ismprayernetwork.org\n‎\n‎1. WE PRAY EVERY DAY! TO SUBMIT YOUR PRAYER MEETING REPORT, KINDLY FOLLOW THE STEP-BY-STEP GUIDE ACCORDINGLY.\"\n‎\n‎1. \"Kindly download and activate the KingsChat app to enable swift submission of your Prayer Meeting Reports @ \"ISM PRAYER ROOMS CONTENT HUB\". Join -using this KingsChat URL: https://www.kingsch.at/jl/bld0YW\n‎\n‎2. Kindly share your prayer meeting link to ensure a detailed record of your prayer group within your region is maintained.\n‎\n‎You can host your prayer meeting using the ISM Prayer Network platform.\n‎\n‎Prayer Network Platform: 🔗 Join Using Link: ismprayernetwork.org/testimonies\n‎\n‎\n‎PRAYER: We pray daily, and we are increasing every day. Our prayer times are the same as today (stated time of prayer meeting). You are kindly encouraged to invite other Ministers of the Gospel from all around the world to join us. God bless you.\n‎\n‎If you are here and require us to pray with you or counsel with you, kindly wait after the benediction so that we can give you adequate attention.\n‎\n‎GRATITUDE: We thank you for your invaluable partnership with the ISM. God is doing great and mighty things through the International School of Ministry and through our dear Man of God all around the world.\n‎\n‎Furthermore, your offerings, tithes, and special seeds should kindly be paid into any of the ISM accounts, also, offerings for other ISM & Love world projects are being received. God will honor your seed sown and grant you the desires of your hearts. He will replenish you and your ministries in a thousand-fold, Amen.\n‎\n‎_ISM ... Impacting Ministers for Effective Ministry", "title": "ANNOUNCEMENT FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 21ST, SEPTEMBER 2026.", "archived": false, "category": "general", "image_url": null, "is_active": true, "created_at": "2026-09-21T09:02:12.611913+00:00", "created_by": null, "updated_at": "2026-09-21T09:02:12.611913+00:00", "published_at": "2026-09-21T09:02:12.611913+00:00"}'),
  ('99961ad8-38c4-4891-a91b-1a183289c112', '2026-09-21 09:25:53.146444+00', '3d40f6e5-08ad-4cf3-a92b-0a31058da012', 'ebunregina.ism@gmail.com', 'super-admin', 'INSERT', 'prayer_weeks', '46929857-2e03-454b-bfa3-f05b8c0f1f9c', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 21st  SEPTEMBER, 2026.', NULL, NULL, '{"id": "46929857-2e03-454b-bfa3-f05b8c0f1f9c", "intro": "GROWTH IS NOT A SECRET; IT IS THE PRODUCT OF REVELATION, RIGHT APPLICATION, AND CONSISTENT PRACTICE OF GOD’S PRINCIPLES. AMEN!  WE ARE IN OUR BEAUTIFUL MONTH OF GROWTH! \n‎Colossians 1:10 (KJV) “That ye might walk worthy of the Lord unto all pleasing, being fruitful in every good work, and increasing in the knowledge of God.”\n‎", "title": "PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 21st  SEPTEMBER, 2026.", "points": [{"body": "                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n‎Pray for the nations of the world, their leaders, and governing authorities, that they will be guided by divine wisdom, justice, righteousness, and truth in the formulation and implementation of laws and policies.\n‎Pray against the enactment or misuse of hate-speech policies and laws in ways that could unjustly restrict lawful expression, silence the proclamation of the Gospel, or hinder the free exercise of faith. Declare that every policy that contradicts righteousness, justice, and fundamental freedoms is overturned, while laws that promote peace, dignity, and the wellbeing of all people are established. Declare that the Gospel continues to have free course and be glorified in every nation, and that Christians everywhere are granted boldness to preach Christ openly and without unlawful hindrance.", "time": "00:00 AM TO 00:09 AM GMT+1       ", "focus": "‎PRAY FOR THE NATIONS AND FOR FREEDOM OF EXPRESSION     ", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "\n2 Thessalonians 3:2 (KJV): “And that we may be delivered from unreasonable and wicked men: for all men have not faith.”"}, {"body": "                                                        \n‎Pray earnestly in tongues of the Spirit, and in accordance with the verses of Scripture above, for ministers of the gospel and Christian associations around the world. ", "time": "00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1   ", "focus": " PRAYER FOR EVERY MINISTER OF THE GOSPEL.             ", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "2 Thessalonians 3:1-3 says, ‘Finally, brethren, pray for us, that the word of the Lord may have free course, and be glorified, even as it is with you: And that we may be delivered from unreasonable and wicked men: for all men have not faith. But the Lord is faithful, who shall establish you, and keep you from evil’."}, {"body": "                                                                                                                                                               \nPray for young people around the world, declaring God’s protection, health, wisdom, and salvation over them. Pray specially for those who are sick among God’s people, that they receive healing, strength, and restoration through the power of the Holy Spirit. Pray for an increased measure of God’s grace upon young adults and children throughout the world. Declare that they are strengthened, established, and increasing in the knowledge of God, walking in faith, love, unity, and the power of the Spirit.", "time": " 00:20AM to 00:29AM", "focus": "PRAY FOR HEALING, WISDOM AND DIVINE PRESERVATION FOR CHILDREN AND YOUNG ADULTS.               ", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "2 Corinthians 12:9 (KJV) “And he said unto me, my grace is sufficient for thee: for my strength is made perfect in weakness.”\n‎"}, {"body": "                                             \n‎\n‎Pray in Spirit, and for the body of Christ the world over, that they may walk in the unity of the Spirit and with a united front, stronger and stronger as we strive for the faith of the gospel, eagerly awaiting the coming of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ. Pray that the ongoing ISM Ministers and leaders conferences around the world will further strengthen, unite and beautified God''s people. Amen. ", "time": "00:30 AM to 00:39 AM GMT+1  ", "focus": "    ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE: PRAY FOR UNITY, STRENGTH AND EXPANSION TO THE BODY OF CHRIST ALL AROUND THE WORLD.", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "Ephesians 4:1-6 says, ‘I therefore, the prisoner of the Lord, beseech you that ye walk worthy of the vocation wherewith ye are called, With all lowliness and meekness, with longsuffering, forbearing one another in love; Endeavoring to keep the unity of the Spirit in the bond of peace. There is one body, and one Spirit, even as ye are called in one hope of your calling; One Lord, one faith, one baptism, One God and Father of all, who is above all, and through all, and in you all’.\n‎"}], "archived": false, "song_url": "‎ https://ceflix.org/videos/watch/1861297/you-are-the-lord-by-loveworld-singers) ", "is_active": true, "conclusion": ". Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspirations from the PRAISE NIGHT with Pastor Chris and Monthly Cell leaders training with highly esteemed Executive Minister. \n‎2. Rhapsody Devotion - 00:50 am\n‎3. Book review: 7 Spirits of God. \n‎4. Announcements - 00: 55 am\n‎5. Offering and tithe\n‎6. Reiteration of instructions to those joining for the first and those requiring counseling\n‎7. Appreciation\n‎8. Benediction", "created_at": "2026-09-21T09:25:53.146444+00:00", "created_by": null, "song_title": "‎(CEFLIX LINK: https://ceflix.org/videos/watch/1861297/you-are-the-lord-by-loveworld-singers) ", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T09:25:53.146444+00:00", "week_start": "2026-09-21", "song_artist": "You Are the Lord by Love world Singers", "song_lyrics": "\n‎Jesus, the heir of sovereignty\n‎There’s salvation for everyone\n‎Because you died and rose\n‎Your kingdom is established in our hearts\n‎now and for all eternity\n‎\n‎You are the One, Lord\n‎Who sits upon the throne\n‎Who gave up everything\n‎To bring us liberty\n‎You were crucified\n‎Oh what a sacrifice\n‎You paid for mankind\n‎To make a kingdom of priests\n‎\n‎Worthy\n‎Worthy is the lamb\n‎Worthy, worthy\n‎Worthy is the lamb\n‎Worthy\n‎Worthy is the lamb\n‎Precious lamb upon the throne\n‎Precious lamb upon the throne\n‎Precious lamb upon the throne", "affirmations": "\n‎AFFIRMATIONS: \n‎This is my year of Manifestation\n‎This is my month of Growth \n‎I am growing in everything \n‎I am increasing in everything \n‎I am walking in the blessings of Abraham \n‎I am an heir according to the promise \n‎Growth is my life\n‎Growth is my inheritance \n‎I am licensed to grow \n‎I keep growing \n‎I grow without limitations \n‎Everything about me grows\n‎I grow in everything \n‎My seed grows in to a great harvest \n‎I grow in the things of God\n‎My finances grow without limits\n‎My soul winning efforts grows\n‎The souls I win, grow to maturity \n‎My service in the house of God grows\n‎I am a partaker of the grace for growth on our man of God, Pastor Chris \n‎I grow none stop in the name of the Lord Jesus Christ \n‎This is my blessing\n‎Growth, growth, growth every where \n‎Supernatural growth \n‎Unstoppable growth \n‎Growth without boundaries \n‎I have the life of God in me\n‎My life is one with God\n‎Daily, I increase in my knowledge of God\n‎I meditate on the word daily\n‎I grow in the word daily\n‎I have power over everything that hurts or binds\n‎Sickness is far from me\n‎I am healthy and strong\n‎I have the life of God in me \n‎As He is, so am I in this world\n‎I am a miracle!\n‎I am a consistent soul winner\n‎I am a consistent giver\n‎I serve the Lord with my spirit \n‎I am full of the word\n‎I know what to do at all times\n‎I am wise and I increase in wisdom today \n‎As I study the word, I increase in wisdom \n‎As I meditate on the word, I increase in wisdom \n‎The wisdom of God is heard in my voice and seen in my actions\n‎I am prefect\n‎My life goes upward and forward only\n‎My growth is evident for all to see\n‎Everyone that knows me, can testify of my growth \n‎I am growing in my financial capacity \n‎I am completing my wonders with ease\n‎I am completing my diamonds with ease \n‎Today, my life and growth brings pleasure to the Lord!\n‎Glory to God!\n‎\n‎𝗦𝗣𝗘𝗔𝗞 𝗜𝗡 𝗢𝗧𝗛𝗘𝗥 𝗧𝗢𝗡𝗚𝗨𝗘𝗦 ", "confession_topic": "GROWTH  SCRIPTURE: ", "confession_scripture": "Luke 2:52 NIV)*- And Jesus grew in wisdom and stature, and in favor with God and men"}'),
