  ('181a4650-2193-41bb-a196-7972fca4f8f5', '2026-10-12 08:18:07.341561+00', '3d40f6e5-08ad-4cf3-a92b-0a31058da012', 'ebunregina.ism@gmail.com', 'super-admin', 'UPDATE', 'site_settings', 'de943f2e-ad13-40c3-b4ec-55ecc66d13b7', NULL, '{value}', '{"id": "de943f2e-ad13-40c3-b4ec-55ecc66d13b7", "key": "bank_details", "value": {"bank_name": "Parralex Bank", "account_name": "ISM Prayer Network", "account_number": "0123456789"}, "updated_at": "2026-02-27T12:11:42.582022+00:00"}', '{"id": "de943f2e-ad13-40c3-b4ec-55ecc66d13b7", "key": "bank_details", "value": {"region": "USA / North America", "bank_name": "JPMorgan Chase Bank", "account_name": "Christ Embassy International Office", "bank_address": "Hwy 6 & W Airport - 81 USA", "account_number": "863283187"}, "updated_at": "2026-10-12T08:18:07.357+00:00"}'),
  ('f3d91ccd-48f1-4b34-9c98-87a49802fe7d', '2026-10-12 08:33:20.90897+00', '3d40f6e5-08ad-4cf3-a92b-0a31058da012', 'ebunregina.ism@gmail.com', 'super-admin', 'INSERT', 'announcements', '71576e00-7ee7-4057-8cd6-22513c353e8e', 'ANNOUNCEMENT FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 12TH OCTOBER, 2026.', NULL, NULL, '{"id": "71576e00-7ee7-4057-8cd6-22513c353e8e", "body": "‎THE COUNTDOWN IS ON: 11 DAYS TO GO! THE UPCOMING HEALING STREAMS LIVE HEALING SERVICES WITH OUR DEAR MAN OF GOD!!!! PRAISE GOD\n‎\n‎Be a part of it as we partner with our man of God to extend God''s mercy to the sick and needy around the world, still in the race to reach the last lost soul!. Partner by giving today through any ISM platform and indicate the purpose. \n💖 ISM PARTNERSHIP PLATFORMS\n🌐 ISM Online: https://christembassy-ism.org/onlinepay\n📱 Espees (LoveWorld App) – Merchant Code: CEISM2\n🌍 KingsPay (Foreign Currency) – Account: ISMNT\n🏦 Any ISM Regional Account\n\n🙏🏻 SHARE THE TESTIMONY OF GOD''S FAITHFUL IN YOUR LIFE, AS YOU HAVE PRAYED\n- send your testimony to KC @ ismprayernetwork\nWebsite- ismprayernetwork.org/teatimony\n\n‎📢🔥 THE REBROADCAST IS LIVE! — OCTOBER ISM CELL LEADERS’ TRAINING WITH THE HIGHLY ESTEEMED EXECUTIVE MINISTER & ISM DIRECTOR🔥📢\n\nBeloved Pastors and Leaders, kindly watch the inspiring training with our Highly Esteemed Executive Minister, Pastor Deola Phillips, and receive powerful insights on the Month of Mercies and our responsibility to extend God’s mercies to nations and communities through the upcoming Healing Streams — THE HOUSE OF MERCY ! 🏠❤️🔥\n🔗 ISM Cell Leaders:\nhttps://app.christembassy-ism.org/cell\n🌍 ISM Cell Members & Stakeholders :\nhttps://school.christembassy-ism.com/training\n\n📌 ACTION PLAN FOR THIS WEEK ✅\n1️⃣ Download the Cell Meeting Outline and organize your cell meeting through CLF:\n🔗 https://app.christembassy-ism.org/cell\n2️⃣ Submit your Cell Meeting Reports on CLF.\n3️⃣ Share faith-lifting testi:\n📸 https://www.kingsch.at/jl/TE95UT\n4️⃣ Submit Offering Slips to your Liaison Manager\n5️⃣ JOIN or start an ISM Cell in your city\n\nThank you and God bless you for your labor of love\n\n‎📅 UPCOMING GLOBAL PROGRAMS & EVENTS WITH PASTOR CHRIS — *2026\n‎\n‎🍂 OCTOBER 2026\n‎💫 Healing Streams Live Healing Services\n‎📅 Friday, 23rd – Sunday, 25th October 2026\n‎🏢 Onsite\n\nBeloved Pastor,\nHealing is coming to your nation, city or village through the October Healing Streams Live Healing Services with Pastor Chris!\n\n🗓️ Friday, October 23 – Sunday, October 25, 2026\n🕑 2:00 PM (GMT+1) Daily\nLuke 10:9 (MSG)\n“Heal the sick and tell them, ‘God’s Kingdom is right on your doorstep!’”\nThis is your moment to begin right where God has placed you — with your own congregation. Activate the D.O.O.R.S.T.E.P Strategy starting from the people already under your care, then stretch outward to the sick, the unreached, and the unsaved in your community.\nThe sick will be healed, the distressed will find hope, and the unreached will encounter the living Christ — beginning in your church and overflowing into your location.\n🔥 D.O.O.R.S.T.E.P STRATEGY – START WITH YOUR CONGREGATION TODAY\nD – Digital Takeover\nCreate and share your unique link immediately. Equip every member of your church to flood their platforms with invitations, pictures, and videos. Let the world see that the power of God is already at work in your centre.\nO – Outreaches & Crusades\nOrganise quick outreaches led by your members. Reach the sick nearby and bring them in. As your congregation steps out, the anointing will flow through them and into your centre.\nO – Offline Distribution\nDistribute materials within your church first, confirm transportation for members and invitees, and ensure every person arrives. \nR – TV and Radio Bombardment\nConfirm and monitor all local TV and radio broadcasts. Make your church contact number visible. \nS – Saturation Evangelism\nDeploy teams from your congregation for door-to-door and street invitations. Saturate your area.\nT – Translations\nGet every translator and language centre fully ready. Send pictures of your hubs. Multitudes from every tongue will encounter the healing power of God in your centre.\nE – Engage Youth & Children\nStir up the youths, teens, and children in your church. Empower them to invite their friends and family. \nP – Project Hope.\n\nLead your members to reach hospitals, orphanages, and special locations with love. Arrange for the live stream or rebroadcast. \n\n‎🙏 Global Prayer and Fasting\n‎📅 Tuesday, 27th – Thursday, 29th October 2026\n‎\n‎🍁 NOVEMBER 2026\n‎🌍 Loveworld Expo with International Pastors’ and Partners’ Conference ( IPPC) Monday, 9th – Sunday, 15th November 2026🏢 Onsite\n‎\n‎Other Important announcements for today are as follows:\n‎1. REGISTER TODAY FOR THE ISM ONLINE SCHOOL:\n‎➡ @ school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎SO MUCH TO EXPECT AND GAIN AT THE ISM ONLINE SCHOOL\n‎ENROL NOW- school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎\n‎2. POST - GMC ACTIVITIES:\n‎\n‎2A. HAPPENING THROUGHOUT THE MONTH OF AUGUST - NOVEMBER: ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE in your city, country and region\n‎\n‎kindly choose a date and Start planning for the meeting with your liaison manager\n‎We are available for effective planning and execution with every team.\n‎\n‎Register your conference @:\n‎https://ministersconference.christembassy-ism.org\n\nGET THESE NEWLY DEVELOPED SOLUTION KI\n‎", "title": "ANNOUNCEMENT FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 12TH OCTOBER, 2026.", "archived": false, "category": "general", "image_url": null, "is_active": true, "created_at": "2026-10-12T08:33:20.90897+00:00", "created_by": null, "updated_at": "2026-10-12T08:33:20.90897+00:00", "published_at": "2026-10-12T08:33:20.90897+00:00"}'),
  ('c1cb2b86-dc25-48ee-bf92-6d0a1876117f', '2026-10-12 08:54:24.580671+00', '3d40f6e5-08ad-4cf3-a92b-0a31058da012', 'ebunregina.ism@gmail.com', 'super-admin', 'INSERT', 'prayer_weeks', 'a5ae62c8-22ea-4303-b5dc-368fd4882689', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK STARTING MONDAY 12TH OCTOBER, 2026.', NULL, NULL, '{"id": "a5ae62c8-22ea-4303-b5dc-368fd4882689", "intro": "\n‎ISAIAH 49:15 (KJV) “CAN A WOMAN FORGET HER SUCKING CHILD, THAT SHE SHOULD NOT HAVE COMPASSION ON THE SON OF HER WOMB? YEA, THEY MAY FORGET, YET WILL I NOT FORGET THEE.” YOU WILL EXPERIENCE THE VISCERAL COMPASSION OF GOD IN THE NAME OF OUR LORD JESUS, AMEN. GLORY TO GOD!", "title": "PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK STARTING MONDAY 12TH OCTOBER, 2026.", "points": [{"body": "\n‎Pray for kings, presidents and those in positions of authority, that they will receive divine wisdom to govern with justice, integrity and understanding, making decisions that promote peace, stability and the well-being of their nations.\n‎", "time": "00:00 AM TO 00:09 AMGMT+1 ", "focus": "PRAY FOR RIGHTEOUS LEADERSHIP IN THE NATIONS.", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "‎Proverbs 21:1 (KJV) “The king''s heart is in the hand of the LORD, as the rivers of water: he turneth it whithersoever he will.”"}, {"body": "‎Pray that ministers will receive clear direction, divine wisdom and understanding from the Holy Spirit as they lead their ministries. Pray that they will discern God’s purpose accurately and make decisions that advance the Gospel and produce lasting impact.", "time": "00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1", "focus": "‎PRAY FOR DIVINE DIRECTION AND WISDOM FOR MINISTERS.", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "‎Isaiah 30:21 (KJV) “And thine ears shall hear a word behind thee, saying, This is the way, walk ye in it...”"}, {"body": "‎Intercede specially for the lost in our world, that they be turned from darkness to light and from the power of Satan unto God, through the ministries and activities of the Saints for the upcoming Healing streams. Amen.", "time": "00:20AM to 00:29AM", "focus": " PRAY FOR SALVATION OF SOULS THOUGH THE UPCOMING HEALING STREAMS LIVE HEALING SERVICES WITH PASTOR CHRIS.", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "‎Isaiah 45:8 says, Drop down, ye heavens, from above, and let the skies pour down righteousness: let the earth open, and let them bring forth salvation, and let righteousness spring up together; I the LORD have created it’."}, {"body": "‎Pray for the effective coordination and operation of every ISM pastors, ministries, minister, and prayer group, that all preparations and mobilization efforts will be carried out with excellence and that the Healing Streams Live Healing Service will have a far-reaching impact through the International school of Ministry", "time": "00:30 AM to 00:39 AM * ", "focus": "*PRAY FOR THE EFFECTIVE OPERATION OF THE ISM MINISTERS TOWARDS THE UPCOMING HEALING STREAMS LIVE HEALING SERVICE WITH PASTOR CHRIS", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": ". Colossians 4:17 — “Take heed to the ministry which thou hast received in the Lord, that thou fulfil it.”"}], "archived": false, "song_url": " ‎https://ceflix.org/videos/watch/1888132/the-person-of-sovereign-majesty---by-loveworld-singers", "is_active": true, "conclusion": "CONCLUSION\n‎1. Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspirations from the Global Prayer and Fasting with Pastor Chris and Monthly Cell leaders training with highly esteemed Executive Minister.\n‎2. Rhapsody Devotion - 00:50 am\n‎3. Book review- Seven Spirits of God\n‎4. Announcements - 00: 55 am\n‎5. Offering and tithe\n‎6. Reiteration of instructions to those joining for the first and those requiring counseling\n‎7. Appreciation\n‎8. Benediction", "created_at": "2026-10-12T08:54:24.580671+00:00", "created_by": null, "song_title": null, "updated_at": "2026-10-12T08:54:24.580671+00:00", "week_start": "2026-10-12", "song_artist": "Dear Spirit of God", "song_lyrics": "You are the Holy One\n‎You are the power of God\n‎You are the life giver\n‎Dear Spirit of God\n‎You are the righteous One\n‎The Father of Christ, our Lord\n‎Of Sovereign majesty\n‎Gracious Comforter\n‎Our Advocate, the intercessor in us\n‎The revealer of truth\n‎You’re forever, of sovereign majesty\n‎Where Your presence is\n‎There all needs are met\n‎You’re the God of all grace\n‎Mighty in this place\n‎Spirit of the Lord, Most Holy\n‎\n‎Holy Spirit, Counsellor whose works abide\n‎Teacher, Friend, Standby, and Guide\n‎Glory of our days\n‎The greater One, all glorious\n‎You’re the God of all grace\n‎Mighty in this place\n‎Spirit of the Lord, Most Holy\n‎Holy Spirit, Counsellor\n‎whose works abide\n‎Teacher, Friend, Standby, and Guide\n‎Glory of our days\n‎The greater One, all glorious\n‎Gracious Comforter\n‎Our Advocate, the intercessor in us\n‎The revealer of truth\n‎You’re forever, of sovereign majesty\n‎Where Your presence is\n‎There, all needs are met\n‎\n‎You’re the God of all grace\n‎Mighty in this place\n‎Spirit of the Lord, Most Holy\n‎Holy Spirit, Counsellor\n‎whose works abide\n‎Teacher, Friend, Standby, and Guide\n‎Glory of our days\n‎The greater One, all glorious\n‎The greater One, all glorious\n‎The greater One, all glorious\n‎He who sits on the throne\n‎We worship You, we worship You\n‎You are great beyond the farthest stars\n‎Eternal rock of ages\n‎We worship You, we worship You\n‎You were there before time began\n‎\n‎Mighty is our King\n‎Glorious in holiness\n‎Awesome in splendor\n‎Highly exalted\n‎King of kings\n‎Lord of all\n‎Lord Jesus You are\n‎Lord Jesus You are\n‎\n‎We praise You Mighty King\n‎We praise You wondrous Lord\n‎We praise You Living Word\n‎Lord Jesus, Lord Jesus", "affirmations": "AFFIRMATIONS\n‎I affirm that the Spirit of God has granted me everything I require to live triumphantly on earth. I am excellent, sound, fruitful, and productive in every good work. Christ is glorified in me today, and His righteousness is unveiled through me. I am the workmanship of God, created in Christ Jesus unto good works. I have God’s righteousness, life, and nature; I am the effulgence of His glory and the express image of His person. Therefore, I think, act, and live as His perfect representation here on the earth.\n‎𝗦𝗣𝗘𝗔𝗞 𝗜𝗡 𝗢𝗧𝗛𝗘𝗥 𝗧𝗢𝗡𝗚𝗨𝗘𝗦", "confession_topic": "MERCY SPEAKS", "confession_scripture": "\n‎SCRIPTURE READING:\n‎Hebrews 4:16 - Let us therefore come boldly unto the throne of grace, that we may obtain mercy, and find grace to help in time of need."}'),
