  ('8f42dd0d-4273-4f23-8fc7-fdf8d53aeedd', '2026-09-07 04:17:46.965893+00', '45fa0a02-01e5-4c50-96c2-ccd007f25bbc', 'divinegodbless90@gmail.com', 'customer', 'INSERT', 'group_members', '5a17f42d-d08a-42f2-b39a-f9d31aafdbe7', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"id": "5a17f42d-d08a-42f2-b39a-f9d31aafdbe7", "user_id": "45fa0a02-01e5-4c50-96c2-ccd007f25bbc", "group_id": "e0402691-a65d-455a-8e9b-a1b3df97b7d8", "joined_at": "2026-09-07T04:17:46.965893+00:00"}'),
  ('bc2c6d61-6f94-4f30-b4de-879f5e8364de', '2026-09-07 08:57:35.026901+00', '3d40f6e5-08ad-4cf3-a92b-0a31058da012', 'ebunregina.ism@gmail.com', 'super-admin', 'INSERT', 'announcements', 'fc7b1a81-b95d-4acc-87cb-327db90ce2b2', '*ANNOUNCEMENT FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 7th, SEPTEMBER 2026.*', NULL, NULL, '{"id": "fc7b1a81-b95d-4acc-87cb-327db90ce2b2", "body": "TRULY! THE LORD IS MINDFUL OF US!\n‎WELCOME TO OUR BEAUTIFUL MONTH OF GROWTH, GLORY BE TO GOD!!\n‎\n‎*COUNTING ON ALL OUR ESTEEMED CELL LEADERS AND MINISTERS TO ORGANIZE ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE THROUGHOUT THE MONTH OF AUGUST AND SEPTEMBER 2026*\n‎\n‎Be a part of it as we strategize with our man of God to reach the last lost soul, by confirming your dates!!!\n‎\n‎*Register your conference @:*\n‎ https://ministersconference.christembassy-ism.org\n‎\n‎We are available for effective planning and execution with you and your team. Contact your liaison manager\n‎\n‎📅 *UPCOMING GLOBAL PROGRAMS & EVENTS WITH PASTOR CHRIS — *2026*\n‎\n‎ 🌍✨\n‎🌟 *SEPTEMBER 2026*\n‎\n‎📺 Your Loveworld Specials — Season 12, Phase 4\n‎📅 Wednesday, 9th – Friday, 11th September 2026\n‎\n‎🙏 *Global Day of Prayer (27th Edition) & Global Prayer and Fasting*\n‎📅 *Friday, 25th – Sunday, 27th September 2026*\n‎\n‎🍂 *OCTOBER 2026*\n‎💫 *Healing Streams Live Healing Services*\n‎📅 Friday, 23rd – Sunday, 25th October 2026\n‎🏢 Onsite\n‎\n‎🙏 Global Prayer and Fasting\n‎📅 Tuesday, 27th – Thursday, 29th October 2026\n‎\n‎🍁 *NOVEMBER 2026*\n‎🌍 *International Pastors’ and Partners’ Conference* ( *IPPC) Monday, 9th – Sunday, 15th* *November 2026🏢 Onsite*\n‎\n‎\n‎(C) Global Kids Connect with Pastor Chris\n‎Sun 13th September, 2026\n‎\n‎(D.) Minister’s praise and prayer conference.\n‎Tuesday 15th September, 2026\n‎\n‎(E.) Praise Night with Pastor Chris\n‎Sun 20th September, 2026\n‎\n‎*Other Important announcements for today are as follows:*\n‎1. REGISTER TODAY FOR THE ISM ONLINE SCHOOL:\n‎➡ @ school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎SO MUCH TO EXPECT AND GAIN AT THE ISM ONLINE SCHOOL\n‎\n‎ENROL NOW- school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎\n‎2. SEPTEMBER CELL LEADERS TRAINING WITH THE HIGHLY ESTEEMED EXECUTIVE MINISTER HOLDS ON TUESDAY 7TH\n‎\n‎Participation Links:\n‎For ISM Cell Leaders:\n‎ https://app.christembassy-ism.org/cell\n‎\n‎For ISM Cell Members and Stakeholders:\n‎ https://school.christembassy-ism.com/training\n‎\n‎3. *POST - GMC ACTIVITIES:*\n‎\n‎3A. HAPPENING THROUGHOUT THE MONTH SEPTEMBER: ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE in your city, country and region\n‎\n‎kindly choose a date and Start planning for the meeting with your liaison manager\n‎We are available for effective planning and execution with every team.\n‎\n‎*Register your conference @:*\n‎ https://ministersconference.christembassy-ism.org\n‎\n‎B. All ISM cell leaders and ministers are encouraged to take and compete at least 1 course in the online school program this month\n‎\n‎LINK: school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎\n‎C. *GET THESE NEWLY DEVELOPED SOLUTION KITS FOR ISM MINISTERS BY OUR DEAR MAN OF GOD, PASTOR CHRIS:*\n‎\n‎1. MYSTERIES ABOUT MONEY: https://ce-ism.org/yLKj4C\n‎\n‎2) SUCCESS PLAYBOOK: https://ce-ism.org/tukgBC\n‎\n‎Kindly click and register first to get your login details before purchasing any of the packages.\n‎\n‎4. Visit the ISM Prayer Network website today:\n‎To get more updates on ISM Minister Prayer Groups and Submit your Prayer meeting reports, create your Prayer account and subscribe for books on Prayer\n‎@ ismprayernetwork.org/prayer-room\n‎\n‎We look forward to receiving testimonies of maximum attendance and great exploits from your daily Prayer meetings @ ismprayernetwork.org/testimony\n‎\n‎1. WE PRAY EVERY DAY! TO SUBMIT YOUR PRAYER MEETING REPORT, KINDLY FOLLOW THE STEP-BY-STEP GUIDE ACCORDINGLY.\"\n‎\n‎1. \"Kindly download and activate the KingsChat app to enable swift submission of your Prayer Meeting Reports @ \"ISM PRAYER ROOMS CONTENT HUB\". Join -using this KingsChat URL: https://www.kingsch.at/jl/bld0YW\nOR\nismprayernetwork.org/report\n‎\n‎2. Kindly share your prayer meeting link to ensure a detailed record of your prayer group within your region is maintained.\n‎\n‎You can host your daily prayer meeting using the ISM Prayer Network platform.\n‎\n‎🔗 Join Using Link: ismprayernetwork.org/groups", "title": "*ANNOUNCEMENT FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 7th, SEPTEMBER 2026.*", "archived": false, "category": "general", "image_url": null, "is_active": true, "created_at": "2026-09-07T08:57:35.026901+00:00", "created_by": null, "updated_at": "2026-09-07T08:57:35.026901+00:00", "published_at": "2026-09-07T08:57:35.026901+00:00"}'),
  ('1f4b1dcc-b4b3-446a-b6c3-0ec308e456ca', '2026-09-07 09:16:25.848092+00', '3d40f6e5-08ad-4cf3-a92b-0a31058da012', 'ebunregina.ism@gmail.com', 'super-admin', 'INSERT', 'prayer_weeks', 'a28eddac-d22e-416f-8a40-2db2d3b153f6', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 7th SEPTEMBER, 2026.*', NULL, NULL, '{"id": "a28eddac-d22e-416f-8a40-2db2d3b153f6", "intro": "GLORY! GLORY! GLORY! WELCOME TO THE MONTH OF GROWTH! GROW, INCREASE, ENLARGE, EXPAND AND BECOME GREATER!\n‎HALLELUJAH!.\n‎Luke 2:40 (KJV) “And the child grew, and waxed strong in spirit, filled with wisdom: and the grace of God was upon him.\n\nFirstly, we express our profound gratitude to our dear Man of God, Rev. Dr. Chris Oyakhilome, DSC, DSC, DD—our model in following the Lord, our loving Father, and our mentor. Sir, we deeply appreciate and love you Sir.\n‎We also extend our heartfelt appreciation to the Executive Minister of the Loveworod Ministry of Ministerial Leadership Development, highly esteemed Pastor Deola Phillips, and the Director of the International School of Ministry, highly esteemed Pastor Jummy Ola-akisanya. Thank you so much, for your unwavering dedication and for the remarkable impact you continually make in our lives through the ISM.\n‎Warm greetings to all esteemed leaders and ministers of the Gospel. We are honored and grateful to have you join us for this prayer session.", "title": "PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY 7th SEPTEMBER, 2026.*", "points": [{"body": "\n‎\n‎Pray for Pakistan and other nations affected by floods, landslides, earthquakes, storms, and other natural disasters. Intercede for divine protection, comfort, healing, and preservation of lives, especially for those in vulnerable and affected communities.\n‎Pray for the leaders of these nations to receive divine wisdom and direction as they coordinate rescue, relief, and restoration efforts. Declare that the Lord will strengthen the nations, bring help to those in distress, restore devastated communities, and cause peace, stability, and prosperity to prevail.\n‎", "time": "00:00 AM TO 00:09 AM GMT+1*", "focus": "*PRAY FOR THE NATIONS OF MEN AND THEIR LEADERS, ESPECIALLY NEPAL AND PAKISTAN.*", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "  Psalm 147:3 (KJV): “He healeth the broken in heart, and bindeth up their wounds."}, {"body": "Pray for ministers of the Gospel around the world, that they be strengthened with might by the Holy Spirit, filled with wisdom, courage, and divine insight to effectively fulfil their God-given assignments. Pray that they remain steadfast in the Word, sensitive to the leading of the Spirit, and bold in proclaiming the Gospel with power, resulting in the salvation, transformation, and establishment of many in Christ. Pray for divine protection, provision, and grace upon ministers, their families, and ministries. Declare that their ministries experience supernatural growth, expansion, and greater global influence, with doors of opportunity opened for the Gospel in nations and communities. Pray that they continually abound in the work of the Lord, prevailing over every opposition and bringing forth lasting fruits to the glory of God.", "time": "00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1*", "focus": "FOR GROWTH, IMPACT AND STRENGTH FOR MINISTERS AROUND THE GLOBE.", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "Galatians 5:22-23 says, ''But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, longsuffering, gentleness, goodness, faith, Meekness, temperance: against such there is no law''.\n‎"}, {"body": "‎Pray for men and women around the world, whose hearts the Lord has stirred to fight in defense of justice, truth, the oppressed, and for God''s people and the churches of Christ. That they''ll be bold to stand firm, full of courage to do the Lord''s will, for His glory. The Lord make them victorious over all their adversaries in Jesus'' name. Amen.\n‎", "time": "00:20AM to 00:29AM*", "focus": "*PRAY FOR THOSE WHO STAND FIRM FOR TRUTH, JUSTICE, AND RIGHTEOUSNESS*", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "2 Samuel 10:12 (NIV) Joab said to his brother Abishai, ''Be strong, and let us fight bravely for our people and the cities of our God. The LORD will do what is good in his sight''.\n‎"}, {"body": "Pray for every new partners raised and connected to our man of God and the ISM from every nation, with a commitment to advancing the Gospel and supporting the work of the ministry. Pray that together with the existing partners they will be strengthened, inspired, and increasingly effective in their partnership, giving and kingdom assignments. Declare that the Lord’s grace, wisdom, favor, and resources abound towards every partner, enabling them to fulfil their purpose and produce lasting results.", "time": "00:30 AM to 00:39 AM GMT+1*", "focus": "PRAY FOR THE GREATER EFFECTIVENESS AND KINGDOM IMPACT OF ISM PARTNERS WORLDWIDE.*", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "2 Corinthians 9:6–8 (KJV) “But this I say, He which sowed sparingly shall reap also sparingly; and he which sowed bountifully shall reap also bountifully. Every man according as he purposeth in his heart, so let him give; not grudgingly, or of necessity: for God loves a cheerful giver. And God is able to make all grace abound toward you; that ye, always having all sufficiency in all things, may abound to every good work.”"}], "archived": false, "song_url": "‎( https://ceflix.org/videos/watch/1890194/fully-god-fully-man-by-loveworld-singers)", "is_active": true, "conclusion": "CONCLUSION:*\n‎1. Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspirations from the Global Communion Service with Pastor Chris and Monthly Cell leaders training with highly esteemed Executive Minister.\n‎2. Rhapsody Devotion - 00:50 am\n‎3. Book review- How to pray effectively\n‎4. Announcements - 00: 55 am\n‎5. Offering and tithe\n‎6. Reiteration of instructions to those joining for the first and those requiring counseling\n‎7. Appreciation\n‎8. Benediction", "created_at": "2026-09-07T09:16:25.848092+00:00", "created_by": null, "song_title": " FULLY GOD AND FULLY MAN.*", "updated_at": "2026-09-07T09:16:25.848092+00:00", "week_start": "2026-09-07", "song_artist": "BY FAITH AND LOVEWORLD SINGERS", "song_lyrics": "Before the beginning, you were\n‎you came forth, as the Light of men\n‎Not just a messenger, but the message\n‎Lord Jesus, the Son of God\n‎\n‎Image of the invisible God\n‎You left your glory to walk among men\n‎you are faithful and true\n‎\n‎Fully God, fully man\n‎one with the Father\n‎Author of life\n‎\n‎Lord of glory\n‎The Word made flesh\n‎Lord Jesus, the Son of God\n‎\n‎Fully God, fully man\n‎the only true God\n‎and eternal life\n‎Prince of glory\n‎the light of life\n‎\n‎Lord Jesus, Son of the living God\n‎You founded the world by Your Word\n‎Stretched out the heavens by your understanding\n‎the only wise God in Your wisdom\n‎\n‎You died and dealt with sin\n‎you conquered death and hell for man\n‎Ascended in victory\n‎to sit at the right hand of God forevermore\n‎Fully God, fully man\n‎one with the Father\n‎Author of life\n‎\n‎Lord of glory\n‎The Word made flesh\n‎Lord Jesus, the Son of God\n‎Fully God, fully man\n‎the only true God\n‎and eternal life\n‎\n‎Prince of glory\n‎the light of life\n‎Lord Jesus, Son of the living God\n‎\n‎Immortal, invisible\n‎Sun of Righteousness\n‎Wisdom of God\n‎you are great and mighty\n‎\n‎Pure and holy, awesome in splendor\n‎you are great\n‎Immortal, invisible\n‎Sun of Righteousness\n‎Wisdom of God\n‎you are great and mighty\n‎Pure and holy, awesome in splendor\n‎you are great\n‎\n‎Fully God, fully man\n‎one with the Father\n‎Lord Jesus, Son of the living God\n‎", "affirmations": "‎AFFIRMATIONS:\n‎This is my year of Manifestation\n‎This is my month and season of growth!\n‎I grow exceedingly and abundantly!\n‎I affirm that my life is for the glory of God! I was born to give Him honour, and show forth His virtues and perfection in this world. His wisdom, grace, and righteousness are revealed, as He make manifest the savour of His knowledge through me in every place. This is my destiny: living for the One who loved me and gave Himself for me! I’m the epistle of Christ, the effulgence of His glory, the manifestation of His goodness and righteousness. I’m a message read of all men, through whom many are coming to the glory, beauty, perfection, liberty, joy, and the knowledge of Christ. Hallelujah!\n", "confession_topic": " GROWTH", "confession_scripture": " Luke 2:40 (KJV) “And the child grew, and waxed strong in spirit, filled with wisdom: and the grace of God was upon him.”"}'),
  ('f4a780a5-74c2-482b-92da-33a01ae315fd', '2026-09-07 09:29:16.769243+00', '3d40f6e5-08ad-4cf3-a92b-0a31058da012', 'ebunregina.ism@gmail.com', 'super-admin', 'INSERT', 'prayer_weeks', '72e81316-e337-46be-9365-179783dd4785', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING FROM MONDAY 24th- AUGUST, 2026.', NULL, NULL, '{"id": "72e81316-e337-46be-9365-179783dd4785", "intro": "IT IS STILL OUR MONTH OF PROGRESSION!!!\n\nPROVERBS 4:25 (KJV): “LET THINE EYES LOOK RIGHT ON, AND LET THINE EYELIDS LOOK STRAIGHT BEFORE THEE.”\n\nFirstly, we express our profound gratitude to our dear Man of God, Rev. Dr. Chris Oyakhilome, DSC, DSC, DD—our perfect example in following the Lord, our loving Father, and our mentor. Sir, we deeply appreciate and love you.", "title": "PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK, STARTING FROM MONDAY 24th- AUGUST, 2026.", "points": [{"body": "Pray for supernatural progress, advancement, peace, stability, and prosperity, rising above every limitation, stagnation, and retrogression in every nation and the light of God’s word shines brighter in the nations of the world.\n\nPray for wisdom and divine guidance for leaders at every level to make decisions that promote righteousness, justice, peace, and the well-being of their people, advancing good governance, education, healthcare, technology, innovation, infrastructure, and sustainable development.\n\nPray against war, terrorism, violence, political instability, corruption, poverty, economic hardship, division, and social unrest, and declare that peace and stability reign within every nation.\n\n", "time": "00:00 AM TO 00:09 AM GMT+1", "focus": "PRAY FOR THE PEACE AND PROGRESSION IN EVERY NATION.", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "\n\n\nJeremiah 29:7 (KJV) And seek the peace of the city whither I have caused you to be carried away captives, and pray unto the LORD for it: for in the peace thereof shall ye have peace.\n"}, {"body": "Pray for ministers of the Gospel around the world, that they will experience divine peace, supernatural prosperity, continuous advancement, and abundant grace in every area of their lives and ministries. Declare that they are strengthened by the Spirit of God, renewed in their commitment to the Gospel, and equipped with wisdom, knowledge, and spiritual understanding to fulfil their divine assignments effectively. Pray that every minister will walk in God''s perfect will and experience greater dimensions of grace, favour, influence, and impact.\n", "time": " 00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1", "focus": " PRAY FOR PEACE, PROSPERITY AND ADVANCEMENT OF MINISTERS AND THE PROLIFERATION OF THEIR MINISTRIES", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": "Isaiah 54:2–3 (KJV) Enlarge the place of thy tent, and let them stretch forth the curtains of thine habitations: spare not, lengthen thy cords, and strengthen thy stakes;\n\nFor thou shalt break forth on the right hand and on the left; and thy seed shall inherit the Gentiles, and make the desolate cities to be inhabited."}, {"body": "\nDeclare abundance of resources for the ISM Ministers and Leaders Conferences all around the world in Jesus Name. Affirm that every resource needed comes free course unhindered by the power of the Spirit in Jesus Name. Amen!", "time": "00:20 to 00:29* GMT+1", "focus": "DECLARE ABUNDANCE AND OVERFLOW OF FINANCES AND RESOURCES FOR THE ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE ALL AROUND THE WORLD", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "Deuteronomy 33:19 - They shall call the people unto the mountain; there they shall offer sacrifices of righteousness: for they shall suck of the abundance of the seas, and of treasures hid in the sand.\n\nIsaiah 60:5 - Then thou shalt see, and flow together, and thine heart shall fear, and be enlarged; because the abundance of the sea shall be converted unto thee, the forces of the Gentiles shall come unto thee."}, {"body": "Give God thanks and praise for the financial partners of the International School of Ministry around the world; we’ll proclaim the Lord’s supernatural blessings upon them, declaring a great financial harvest of abundance and overflow for every partner.\n\nPray that circumstances are divinely aligned to favor each of them, and that more financial laborers join forces with the man of God to expand the vision of the International School of Ministry.\n", "time": "00:30 AM to 00:39 AM GMT+1 ", "focus": "PRAY FOR ALL THE FINANCIAL PARTNERS OF THE INTERNATIONAL SCHOOL OF MINISTRY", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "\n\n2 Corinthians: 9:10: (TLB): “For God, who gives seed to the farmer to plant, and later on good crops to harvest and eat, will give you more and more seed to plant and will make it grow so that you can give away more and more fruit from your harvest.”\n\nLuke 6:38 : “Give, and it shall be given unto you; good measure, pressed down, and shaken together, and running over, shall men give into your bosom...”"}], "archived": false, "song_url": "https://ceflix.org/videos/watch/1888132/the-person-of-sovereign-majesty---by-loveworld-singers", "is_active": true, "conclusion": "1. Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspirations from the 2026 Global Ministers’ Classroom and Praise Night with Pastor Chris.\n\n2. Rhapsody Devotion - 00:50 am\n\n3. Book review- joint this chariot\n\n4. Announcements - 00: 55 am\n\n5. Offering and tithe\n\n6. Reiteration of instructions to those joining for the first and those requiring counseling\n\n7. Appreciation\n\n8. Benediction", "created_at": "2026-09-07T09:29:16.769243+00:00", "created_by": null, "song_title": " THE PERSON OF SOVEREIGN MAJESTY", "updated_at": "2026-09-07T09:29:16.769243+00:00", "week_start": "2026-08-31", "song_artist": "BY ELI-J", "song_lyrics": "Dear Spirit of God\n\nYou are the Holy One\n\nYou are the power of God\n\nYou are the life giver\n\nDear Spirit of God\n\nYou are the righteous One\n\nThe Father of Christ, our Lord\n\nOf Sovereign majesty\n\nGracious Comforter\n\nOur Advocate, the intercessor in us\n\nThe revealer of truth\n\nYou’re forever, of sovereign majesty\n\nWhere Your presence is\n\nThere all needs are met\n\nYou’re the God of all grace\n\nMighty in this place\n\nSpirit of the Lord, Most Holy\n\nHoly Spirit, Counsellor\n\nwhose works abide\n\nTeacher, Friend, Standby, and Guide\n\nGlory of our days\n\nThe greater One, all glorious\n\nYou’re the God of all grace\n\nMighty in this place\n\nSpirit of the Lord, Most Holy\n\nHoly Spirit, Counsellor\n\nwhose works abide\n\nTeacher, Friend, Standby, and Guide\n\nGlory of our days\n\nThe greater One, all glorious\n\nGracious Comforter\n\nOur Advocate, the intercessor in us\n\nThe revealer of truth\n\nYou’re forever, of sovereign majesty\n\nWhere Your presence is\n\nThere, all needs are met\n\nYou’re the God of all grace\n\nMighty in this place\n\nSpirit of the Lord, Most Holy\n\nHoly Spirit, Counsellor\n\nwhose works abide\n\nTeacher, Friend, Standby, and Guide\n\nGlory of our days\n\nThe greater One, all glorious\n\nThe greater One, all glorious\n\nThe greater One, all glorious (Edited)\n\n", "affirmations": "Precious Father, how you have loved me unconditionally! I trust in Your love and walk in the light of it today as You’re in the light. Hence, I know there’s therefore now no condemnation for me! I belong to You forever. I rejoice to know that You chose me to express Yourself and reveal Your personality and glory in me! I live today and everyday to bring glory to Your Name by manifesting Your grace and displaying Your virtues, and perfections. Thank You, for raising me up and making me to sit together in heavenly places in Christ! Not only does Christ live in me, I’m in Christ, and I function from the heavenly realms of glory, as the heavenly man in Christ. Hallelujah.\n\n\nThe wisdom of God is at work in me, guiding me and showing me the way to go.\n\nChrist has been made wisdom unto me; therefore, I conduct all my affairs with prudence and discretion. I have insight into mysteries and secrets, and the Spirit of wisdom reveals hidden things unto me! Lord, I thank You for Your divine power that’s at work in me today mightily; I’m full of that divine might today, even by the Spirit of God! Thus I’m energized for the supernatural and enabled to live the glorious life, and accomplish my everyday tasks in Jesus’ Name. Amen.\n", "confession_topic": "PROGRESSION", "confession_scripture": " JUDE 1:20 AMPC: “But you, beloved, build yourselves up [founded] on your most holy faith [make progress, rise like an edifice higher and higher], praying in the Holy Spirit.”)\n"}'),
