  ('606e1962-e2e1-431d-9525-a52bd48f5181', '2026-09-28 11:30:04.544342+00', 'd7eaf966-d9df-4cc6-82aa-fff6fb4c4a39', 'joykassy.paine@gmail.com', 'customer', 'INSERT', 'group_members', '07b537b6-2a42-44a2-bde2-30de1bb073a9', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"id": "07b537b6-2a42-44a2-bde2-30de1bb073a9", "user_id": "d7eaf966-d9df-4cc6-82aa-fff6fb4c4a39", "group_id": "5130d0d7-c169-4e21-9be6-4effe575eb2e", "joined_at": "2026-09-28T11:30:04.544342+00:00"}'),
  ('13a4ca05-64b9-46b3-bff6-08ec6ebe553a', '2026-09-29 09:24:11.487981+00', '3d40f6e5-08ad-4cf3-a92b-0a31058da012', 'ebunregina.ism@gmail.com', 'super-admin', 'INSERT', 'announcements', '0d18b9fe-97c7-4f8f-ab28-b4cce7990562', 'ANNOUNCEMENT FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY, 28th, SEPTEMBER 2026.', NULL, NULL, '{"id": "0d18b9fe-97c7-4f8f-ab28-b4cce7990562", "body": "‎IT’S YOUR SEASON OF GROWTH\n‎Grow in grace. Grow in the Word. Grow in impact. Step into greater dimensions!     \n‎GLORY BE TO GOD! HALLELUJAH!\n‎\n‎COUNTING ON ALL OUR ESTEEMED CELL LEADERS AND MINISTERS TO ORGANIZE THE ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE THROUGHOUT THE MONTHS OF AUGUST AND OCTOBER 2026\n‎‎Be part of it as we strategize with our man of God to reach the last lost soul; confirm your dates! \n‎\n‎Register your conference @ ‎https://ministersconference.christembassy-ism.org\n‎\n‎We are available for effective planning and execution with you and your team. Contact your liaison manager\n‎\n‎📅 UPCOMING GLOBAL PROGRAMS & EVENTS WITH PASTOR CHRIS — *2026\n‎\n‎‎🍂 OCTOBER 2026 \n‎💫 Healing Streams Live Healing Services \n‎📅 Friday, 23rd – Sunday, 25th October 2026\n‎🏢 Onsite\n‎JOIN ME PRAY CAMPAIGN – Towards Healing Streams Live Healing Service\n\t‎Select your preferred Date & Time\n\tChoose your number of Prayer Cloud accounts\n\tPick your 15-minute daily Prayer slot\n\n‎‎🍁 NOVEMBER 2026 \n‎🌍 International Pastors’ and Partners’ Conference (IPPC) Monday, 9th – Sunday, 15th November 2026🏢 Onsite\n‎\n‎Other Important announcements for today are as follows:\n‎1.  REGISTER TODAY FOR THE ISM ONLINE SCHOOL:\n‎➡️ @ school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎SO MUCH TO EXPECT AND GAIN AT THE ISM ONLINE SCHOOL\n‎\n‎ENROL NOW- school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎\n‎2.   SEPTEMBER CELL LEADERS TRAINING WITH THE HIGHLY ESTEEMED EXECUTIVE MINISTER HOLDS ON TUESDAY 7TH\n‎\n‎Participation Links: \n‎For ISM Cell Leaders: \n‎https://app.christembassy-ism.org/cell\n‎\n‎For ISM Cell Members and Stakeholders: \n‎https://school.christembassy-ism.com/training\n‎\n‎3. POST - GMC ACTIVITIES:\n‎\n‎3A. HAPPENING THROUGHOUT THE MONTH AUGUST - OCTOBER: ISM MINISTERS AND LEADERS CONFERENCE in your city, country and region \n‎\n‎kindly choose a date and Start planning for the meeting with your liaison manager \n‎We are available for effective planning and execution with every team. \n‎\n‎Register your conference @:\n‎https://ministersconference.christembassy-ism.org\n‎\n‎B. All ISM cell leaders and ministers are encouraged to take and complete at least 1 course in the online school program this month\n‎\n‎LINK: school.christembassy-ism.com\n‎\n‎C. GET THESE NEWLY DEVELOPED SOLUTION KITS FOR ISM MINISTERS BY OUR DEAR MAN OF GOD, PASTOR CHRIS:\n‎\n‎1. MYSTERIES ABOUT MONEY:  https://ce-ism.org/yLKj4C\n‎\n‎2) SUCCESS PLAYBOOK: https://ce-ism.org/tukgBC\n‎\n‎Kindly click and register first to get your login details before purchasing any of the packages.\n‎\n‎4. Visit the ISM Prayer Network website today:\n‎To get more updates on ISM Minister Prayer Network, share your testimonies, and subscribe to Pastor Chris’s books on Prayer\n‎@ https://ismprayernetwork.org/bookstore \n‎\n‎We look forward to receiving testimonies of maximum attendance and great exploits from your daily Prayer meetings @ ismprayernetwork.org/testimony\n‎\n‎1.  WE PRAY EVERY DAY! TO SUBMIT YOUR PRAYER MEETING REPORT, KINDLY FOLLOW THE STEP-BY-STEP GUIDE ACCORDINGLY.\"\n‎\n‎a. \"Kindly download and activate the KingsChat app to enable swift submission of your Prayer Meeting Reports @ \"ISM PRAYER ROOMS CONTENT HUB\". Join -using this KingsChat URL: https://www.kingsch.at/jl/bld0YW \n‎OR\n‎b.  STEPS TO SUBMIT YOUR PRAYER MEETING REPORTS ON THE WEBSITE:\n‎‎Step 1: Log in to your Prayer Network Website – https://ismprayernetwork.org/report \n‎Step 2: Fill in the required Columns with your meeting details \n‎Step 3: Click to upload pictures, then click the submit button.\n‎‎‎‎2.  Kindly share your prayer meeting link to ensure a detailed record of your prayer group within your region is maintained.\n‎\n‎GLORYY!!! You can host your daily prayer meeting using the ISM Prayer Network platform.\n‎‎🔗 Join using this link: https://ismprayernetwork.org/groups  click on create an account \n ‎GRATITUDE: We thank you for your invaluable partnership with the ISM. God is doing great and mighty things through the International School of Ministry and through our dear Man of God all around the world.\n‎\n‎Furthermore, your offerings, tithes, and special seeds should kindly be paid into any of the ISM accounts, also, offerings for other ISM & Loveworld projects are being received. God will honor your seed sown and grant you the desires of your hearts. He will replenish you and your ministries in a thousand-fold, Amen.\n‎\n‎ISM ... Impacting Ministers for Effective Ministry", "title": "ANNOUNCEMENT FOR THE WEEK, STARTING MONDAY, 28th, SEPTEMBER 2026.", "archived": false, "category": "general", "image_url": null, "is_active": true, "created_at": "2026-09-29T09:24:11.487981+00:00", "created_by": null, "updated_at": "2026-09-29T09:24:11.487981+00:00", "published_at": "2026-09-29T09:24:11.487981+00:00"}'),
  ('bf40f3b3-b81e-4a79-965f-52993671a3f2', '2026-09-29 09:47:20.384592+00', '3d40f6e5-08ad-4cf3-a92b-0a31058da012', 'ebunregina.ism@gmail.com', 'super-admin', 'INSERT', 'prayer_weeks', 'ce05ea0b-b4a3-4f13-aa19-1aaa75388712', 'PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK STARTING MONDAY 28TH, SEPTEMBER, 2026.', NULL, NULL, '{"id": "ce05ea0b-b4a3-4f13-aa19-1aaa75388712", "intro": "GROWTH IS OUR NEW REALITY!\n‎\n‎Our capacity is increasing, our influence is expanding, and our impact is multiplying. Prepare for more!\n‎John 15:16 - Ye have not chosen me, but I have chosen you, and ordained you, that ye should go and bring forth fruit, and that your fruit should remain: that whatsoever ye shall ask of the Father in my name, he may give it you.\n‎\n", "title": "PRAYER POINTS FOR THE WEEK STARTING MONDAY 28TH, SEPTEMBER, 2026.", "points": [{"body": "                                                                                                              1\n‎Pray for the nations and their leaders, that God’s wisdom, righteousness, and counsel will guide every decision and policy that affects the people. Pray that leaders will receive divine direction to govern with justice, integrity, and compassion.\n‎Declare that the purposes of God will prevail in every nation, and that every policy, law, and decision contrary to God’s will shall be overturned. Pray for peace, stability, and prosperity across nations, and that the Gospel will have free course, bringing salvation, righteousness, and transformation to every people.\n", "time": "00:00 AM TO 00:09 AM GMT+1                                                                ", "focus": "NATIONS AND THEIR LEADERS. ", "label": "Prayer Point 1", "scripture": "Timothy 2-2:1: I exhort therefore, that, first of all, supplications, prayers, intercessions, and giving of thanks, be made for all men; For kings, and for all that are in authority; that we may lead a quiet and peaceable life in all godliness and honesty."}, {"body": "‎Pray for every minister to experience continual spiritual growth, increased grace, wisdom, strength, and effectiveness in their calling. Pray that their ministries will flourish, expand their reach, and produce lasting results as they faithfully fulfil God’s purpose.\n‎Declare that their influence will increase, their impact will multiply, and their ministries will continually advance, reaching more lives with the Gospel and bringing glory to God.\n‎\n", "time": "00:10 AM to 00:19 AM GMT+1      ", "focus": "PRAY FOR INCREASED GROWTH FOR MINISTERS AND THEIR MINISTRIES.                                   ", "label": "Prayer Point 2", "scripture": " 2 Peter 3:18 — “But grow in grace, and in the knowledge of our Lord and Saviour Jesus Christ…”"}, {"body": "                                                                                                                                                                          Interceding for many around the world suffering from vaccine-related injuries and ailments; pray that God’s grace will be poured out upon them for healing and restoration. Also pray and declare that voices of truth – individuals and organizations fighting for the right causes in nations- will be heard, and evil agendas stopped, in Jesus '' name. Amen.\n", "time": "00:20AM to 00:29AM    ", "focus": "PRAY FOR THOSE AFFECTED BY VACCINES AND THE ADVANCEMENT OF TRUTH.            ", "label": "Prayer Point 3", "scripture": "Psalms 107:17-20 says, “Fools because of their transgression, and because of their iniquities, are afflicted. Their soul abhorreth all manner of meat; And they draw near unto the gates of death. Then they cry unto the LORD in their trouble, And he saveth them out of their distresses. He sent his word, and healed them, and delivered them from their destructions.”\n‎"}, {"body": "‎Pray fervently in the Spirit, declaring that the gospel will be fully preached and established throughout your nation and your catchments by the mighty power of God’s Spirit.  Give thanks to the Lord for the many opportunities He is opening for rapid spread of the gospel, leading to the fulfillment of His work. Also declare the endless increase of Christ’s rule, dominion, and peace over nations and cities of the world. Amen!\n\n", "time": "", "focus": "PRAY FOR AN UNSTOPPABLE SPREAD OF THE GOSPEL IN YOUR NATION THROUGH THE UPCOMING HEALING STREAMS LIVE HEALING SERVICE.", "label": "Prayer Point 4", "scripture": "\n‎Matthew 24:14 (KJV) ''And this gospel of the kingdom shall be preached in all the world for a witness unto all nations; and then shall the end come''."}], "archived": false, "song_url": "https://kingsspace.online/videos/watch/1884450/holy-most-holy-by-loveworld-singers ", "is_active": true, "conclusion": "CONCLUSION:\n‎1. Prophecies, testimonies, & exaltations. Inspirations from the Global Prayer and Fasting with Pastor Chris and Monthly Cell leaders training with highly esteemed Executive Minister. \n‎2. Rhapsody Devotion - 00:50 am\n‎3. Book review- How to make your faith work. \n‎4. Announcements - 00: 55 am\n‎5. Offering and tithe\n‎6. Reiteration of instructions to those joining for the first time and those requiring counseling\n‎7. Appreciation\n‎8. Benediction\n", "created_at": "2026-09-29T09:47:20.384592+00:00", "created_by": null, "song_title": "HOLY MOST HOLY.", "updated_at": "2026-09-29T09:47:20.384592+00:00", "week_start": "2026-09-29", "song_artist": null, "song_lyrics": "Hallelujah, Hallelujah\n‎Hallelujah, Hallelujah\n‎You’re the One all creation adores\n‎All dominion, might, and power are yours\n‎you are God in the highest\n‎your throne is forever\n‎we bless you, holy God\n‎In all the earth\n‎Hallelujah, Hallelujah, Hallelujah\n‎Hallelujah, Hallelujah, and Hallelujah\n‎we bless you, holy God\n‎\n‎The cherubim’s spread their wings in worship\n‎The seraphim cry holy before you\n‎The thrones bow in worship before Your holiness\n‎The hosts of heaven and earth\n‎Adore Your loveliness; You are most holy\n‎Holy, oh God, You are\n‎Lord, You’re majestic in all Your ways\n‎Hallowed is your name\n‎in heaven and earth for eternity\n‎\n‎Holy, oh God, You are\n‎Lord, You’re majestic in all your ways\n‎Hallowed is your name\n‎in heaven and earth for eternity\n‎Your goodness and mercy are endless\n‎your judgments are ever righteous\n‎Glorious is you might, the only true God\n‎The echoes of your wonders\n‎Are for all eternity, you are most holy\n‎You preside over the council of your holy ones\n‎God of the angel armies\n‎the glory of your faithfulness\n‎is for all generations\n‎\n‎The oceans swell with your praise\n‎the endless fountains of your love\n‎spring forth your splendour\n‎Holy, oh God, You are\n‎Lord, You’re majestic in all your ways\n‎Hallowed is your name\n‎in heaven and earth for eternity\n‎Creator of all things\n‎Time and eternity, The Eternal being\n‎in whom eternity resides\n‎\n‎You dwell in the highest place of endless glory\n‎The deepest depth below trembles at Your presence\n‎The glory of Your presence far surpasses\n‎The widest width and farthest beyond\n‎Great King and God of all the heavens and the earth\n‎Your dynasty reigns through all\n‎Hallelujah to the Most High God, Hallelujah\n‎\n‎Hallelujah, Hallelujah, Hallelujah\n‎Hallelujah, Hallelujah, Hallelujah\n‎Hallelujah, Hallelujah, Hallelujah\n‎\n", "affirmations": "This is my year of manifestation \n‎This is my month of Growth!    I affirm that the eyes of my understanding are enlightened by the Spirit of God through the knowledge of God’s Word, to see and receive every good thing that God has made available unto me in Christ Jesus. The Spirit of God has set me on the path of life; therefore, I walk each day in the reality of my inheritance in Christ! I do not go up to come down in life. For my path is as the shining light that shines brighter and brighter unto the perfect day. I am not where I used to be; I’ve gained the speed of the Spirit. I’m in the center of God’s will for my life. Hallelujah.\n‎𝗦𝗣𝗘𝗔𝗞 𝗜𝗡 𝗢𝗧𝗛𝗘𝗥 𝗧𝗢𝗡𝗚𝗨𝗘𝗦 \n", "confession_topic": null, "confession_scripture": "‎(CONFESSION FOR THE DAY: CONFESSION GUIDE TOPIC: GROWTH SCRIPTURE READING) John 15:2 - Every branch in me that beareth not fruit he taketh away: and every branch that beareth fruit, he purgeth it, that it may bring forth more fruit."}'),
